# Souvenirstand: the friendly vendor behind the stand's counter (upper body
# only; the renderer puts the origin on the top of the counter's first tile).
# Grey bun i/m, light skin e/E with a p cheek, cream blouse c (sleeves and
# collar only, <= 12 px), green apron G/g/j. Faces left, no mirror.
# idle = forearms on the counter, she leans in. telegraph = holds a snow globe
# up high (h/s dome, O/l base), frame 1 = the w glint flares.
# Drafted with a scratch script (interior art + automatic k outline).
sprite = souvenirstand
size   = 16x16
origin = 8,16
anim   = idle      frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = telegraph frames=2 ticks=8 loop
